WEBVTT

00:00:03.440 --> 00:00:06.350
﻿Hello, this is the 1st Lab.

00:00:06.350 --> 00:00:07.350
﻿Chief Allan.

00:00:09.650 --> 00:00:11.980
﻿You want us to send you A5 right now?

00:00:13.190 --> 00:00:15.720
﻿We've only just finished phase 3.

00:00:16.390 --> 00:00:18.420
<i>﻿I'll make the final adjustments.</i>

00:00:18.420 --> 00:00:21.660
﻿- But the armament—
- <i>﻿I told you, I'll do it.</i>

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:23.600
﻿Alright.

00:00:27.170 --> 00:00:28.600
﻿Cease development.

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:30.400
﻿We're rolling out A5.

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:32.370
﻿- Are you serious?
- ﻿No way.

00:00:32.710 --> 00:00:35.970
﻿It's the chief's order.
﻿Do as he says.

00:00:41.810 --> 00:00:45.880
﻿Although it's incomplete,
﻿it's the strongest Gunpla in history.

00:00:46.850 --> 00:00:49.720
﻿Is the World Tournament
﻿getting so unpredictable...

00:00:49.720 --> 00:00:52.820
﻿that Chief Allan actually
﻿needs this machine?

00:02:33.490 --> 00:02:36.390
﻿Thank you for coming
﻿all this way, Chairman.

00:02:36.390 --> 00:02:37.490
﻿Yeah.

00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:40.460
﻿It looks like you're still winning.

00:02:40.460 --> 00:02:42.490
﻿We're now in the best 8.

00:02:42.490 --> 00:02:45.030
﻿We hope to make best 4
﻿in tomorrow's quarterfinals.

00:02:45.360 --> 00:02:48.570
﻿All I want is the championship trophy.

00:02:49.130 --> 00:02:53.040
﻿That's why I invested big bucks
﻿in the Flana Institute.

00:02:53.040 --> 00:02:54.370
﻿We appreciate it.

00:02:54.370 --> 00:02:56.710
﻿Just win. That's an order.

00:02:56.710 --> 00:02:57.310
﻿Yes!

00:02:57.940 --> 00:02:59.410
﻿Grandpa! Grandpa!

00:03:01.150 --> 00:03:02.810
﻿What now, Lucas!?

00:03:03.080 --> 00:03:05.980
﻿I can watch Gunpla Battle
﻿tomorrow, right?

00:03:06.420 --> 00:03:08.890
﻿Yeah, you can.

00:03:08.890 --> 00:03:11.090
﻿Your team's gonna win, right?

00:03:11.090 --> 00:03:12.420
﻿But of course.

00:03:13.190 --> 00:03:15.630
﻿Because I'm going to give you...

00:03:15.630 --> 00:03:19.360
﻿a nice big trophy for
﻿your birthday present.

00:03:19.830 --> 00:03:21.830
﻿Thank you, Grandpa!

00:03:33.180 --> 00:03:35.950
﻿So he got involved in Gunpla Battle
﻿for his grandson.

00:03:38.080 --> 00:03:42.620
﻿That's a crazy indulgence
﻿but he's an important sponsor for us.

00:03:43.490 --> 00:03:45.120
﻿We gotta humor him.

00:03:45.690 --> 00:03:46.720
﻿What rubbish.

00:03:46.860 --> 00:03:49.260
﻿Did you say something?

00:03:49.530 --> 00:03:50.260
﻿No.

00:03:51.030 --> 00:03:55.400
﻿I'll do my best for Nemesis's victory.

00:04:03.940 --> 00:04:06.580
﻿Those two are still winning!?

00:04:07.580 --> 00:04:09.480
﻿They're in the best 4!?

00:04:10.180 --> 00:04:13.180
﻿You said to me, "Leave it to me"!

00:04:13.180 --> 00:04:15.390
﻿Explain it to me, Miss Baker!
﻿Huh?

00:04:16.120 --> 00:04:18.320
﻿Hey! Where are you?

00:04:18.320 --> 00:04:20.160
﻿Miss Baker!

00:04:24.960 --> 00:04:27.230
﻿Sei Iori. Reiji.

00:04:27.230 --> 00:04:31.400
﻿I never imagined that
﻿you'd beat Nils Nielsen.

00:04:32.670 --> 00:04:34.940
﻿Now, close your eyes.

00:04:36.010 --> 00:04:38.340
﻿Correct your posture and breathing.

00:04:39.810 --> 00:04:41.750
﻿Clear your mind.

00:04:43.350 --> 00:04:46.350
﻿Go to the depths of your memory.

00:04:46.350 --> 00:04:50.420
﻿Where the secret of
﻿the Plavsky particle is sleeping...

00:04:51.620 --> 00:04:53.160
﻿He's asleep!?

00:04:53.160 --> 00:04:54.090
﻿Nils.

00:04:54.430 --> 00:04:56.530
﻿I don't think Reiji knows anything.

00:04:56.530 --> 00:05:00.130
﻿Then, do you know the secret?

00:05:00.600 --> 00:05:02.030
﻿I don't know either.

00:05:02.670 --> 00:05:07.200
﻿The only person I can think of
﻿who might know something is my dad.

00:05:07.210 --> 00:05:08.310
﻿Your dad?

00:05:08.410 --> 00:05:11.310
﻿Yeah. He's the manager of our store.

00:05:13.040 --> 00:05:16.710
﻿I heard that about 10 years ago,
﻿he was involved as a monitor...

00:05:16.720 --> 00:05:19.520
﻿in the development of
﻿the Gunpla Battle system.

00:05:23.590 --> 00:05:26.460
﻿Rinny, come home soon.

00:05:26.590 --> 00:05:27.630
﻿That's it!

00:05:28.890 --> 00:05:31.630
﻿10 years ago,
﻿you were still 3 years old!

00:05:32.160 --> 00:05:36.530
﻿If you saw something when
﻿your dad was helping develop it,

00:05:37.140 --> 00:05:40.940
﻿the memory would be stored
﻿in the depths of your consciousness!

00:05:41.440 --> 00:05:43.710
﻿Don't you think so?

00:05:43.710 --> 00:05:45.340
﻿I... I'm not sure.

00:05:46.950 --> 00:05:48.550
﻿May I try?

00:05:48.750 --> 00:05:50.350
﻿Try what?

00:05:51.880 --> 00:05:55.690
﻿Awakening your memory with hypnotherapy.

00:05:55.690 --> 00:05:58.620
﻿I have to repair the Star Build Strike.

00:05:58.620 --> 00:06:00.360
﻿I'll help you when we're done.

00:06:01.060 --> 00:06:02.560
﻿It'll just take a minute.

00:06:03.900 --> 00:06:04.960
﻿Wait...

00:06:05.200 --> 00:06:07.300
﻿No, I can't wait.

00:06:08.000 --> 00:06:09.570
﻿You two seem to be having fun.

00:06:10.400 --> 00:06:11.440
﻿Mao!?

00:06:13.310 --> 00:06:15.140
﻿Misaki!

00:06:15.140 --> 00:06:15.710
﻿What!?

00:06:15.940 --> 00:06:18.580
﻿Mi...sa...ki!

00:06:19.580 --> 00:06:21.110
﻿Shut up!

00:06:21.110 --> 00:06:22.550
﻿I can't sleep, Mao.

00:06:22.550 --> 00:06:25.880
﻿Mr. Reiji, how could you do that
﻿to a heartbroken guy!

00:06:26.150 --> 00:06:29.050
﻿What? You wanna fight!?

00:06:29.050 --> 00:06:31.060
﻿Mr. Reiji, you moron!

00:06:31.060 --> 00:06:33.960
﻿Stop it, Reiji and Mao!

00:06:33.960 --> 00:06:36.730
﻿Sei, let's start the hypnotherapy.

00:06:36.730 --> 00:06:37.730
﻿With all this?

00:06:40.130 --> 00:06:43.700
﻿Oh, man. They're so annoying.

00:06:44.340 --> 00:06:48.540
﻿I'm nervous with
﻿the quarterfinals coming up.

00:06:49.640 --> 00:06:51.680
﻿It's a little early, but...

00:06:52.780 --> 00:06:54.880
﻿Let's go, my partner.

00:07:02.170 --> 00:07:03.860
Mr. Ral.

00:07:03.860 --> 00:07:06.390
﻿I'm sorry I'm not Kirara.

00:07:06.390 --> 00:07:09.890
﻿She already headed
﻿to the arena for work.

00:07:11.360 --> 00:07:14.030
﻿Thank you for your concern,
﻿Lieutenant.

00:07:15.670 --> 00:07:18.400
﻿The quarterfinals are finally here.

00:07:18.400 --> 00:07:19.200
﻿Yes.

00:07:19.970 --> 00:07:24.710
﻿Your opponent is Aila Jyrkiainen, who
﻿beat the previous champion, Carlos Kaiser,

00:07:24.710 --> 00:07:30.780
﻿and has kept her undefeated record
﻿in the World Tournament.

00:07:31.580 --> 00:07:33.920
﻿Yeah, that's a pretty tall order.

00:07:33.920 --> 00:07:35.650
﻿Do you have a chance?

00:07:35.650 --> 00:07:37.720
﻿I'll manage to find one.

00:07:38.820 --> 00:07:40.920
﻿They're waiting for me
﻿in the semifinals.

00:07:41.930 --> 00:07:43.860
﻿It was a draw in the qualifiers...

00:07:45.030 --> 00:07:47.800
﻿We have to settle it once and for all.

00:07:53.710 --> 00:07:55.270
﻿The best of luck.

00:07:57.340 --> 00:08:01.280
﻿You, the famous "Blue Giant",
wishing me luck...

00:08:01.280 --> 00:08:03.280
﻿It's reassuring.

00:08:10.290 --> 00:08:12.120
﻿The Wing Gundam Fenice.

00:08:13.160 --> 00:08:16.430
﻿Its firepower and mobility,
﻿its support mecha...

00:08:16.690 --> 00:08:21.130
﻿And the control techniques
﻿of its fighter, Ricardo Fellini.

00:08:21.800 --> 00:08:23.870
﻿All of them are class S.

00:08:24.770 --> 00:08:26.670
﻿There's no problem.

00:08:26.670 --> 00:08:28.770
﻿- Keep your guard up.
- ﻿I know.

00:08:31.740 --> 00:08:35.610
﻿If I win this battle,
﻿my next opponent is...

00:08:37.320 --> 00:08:38.520
﻿Please stop.

00:08:39.050 --> 00:08:43.450
﻿If you want to deploy the Gundam so badly
﻿you should go out in it yourself!

00:08:45.590 --> 00:08:47.490
﻿You... You hit me!

00:08:48.160 --> 00:08:51.530
﻿Do you really think
﻿I'm such a petty person!?

00:08:53.500 --> 00:08:55.130
﻿You hit me again!

00:08:55.700 --> 00:08:57.840
﻿Not even my father ever hit me!

00:08:58.600 --> 00:09:00.400
﻿That's it! I refuse to go on!

00:09:00.410 --> 00:09:04.340
﻿Mao, what's Sei talking about?

00:09:04.340 --> 00:09:08.150
﻿He's saying Amuro Ray's lines
﻿from the anime Mobile Suit Gundam.

00:09:08.150 --> 00:09:09.350
﻿He's reached episode 9.

00:09:11.180 --> 00:09:17.020
﻿His subconscious memories from age 3
﻿are filled with Gundam dialogue.

00:09:17.020 --> 00:09:17.820
﻿Miss Matilda...

00:09:17.820 --> 00:09:18.960
﻿Sei.

00:09:19.990 --> 00:09:23.360
﻿You're a real Gundam freak.

00:09:23.830 --> 00:09:29.030
﻿The youngest team of Sei Iori and Reiji
﻿have advanced to the best 4!

00:09:29.400 --> 00:09:32.200
﻿What's the motivation
﻿behind their rise?

00:09:32.740 --> 00:09:38.140
﻿I'd like to interview
﻿Sei Iori's classmate, Miss China Kousaka.

00:09:38.710 --> 00:09:42.580
﻿Would you tell me
﻿what Iori's like at school?

00:09:42.810 --> 00:09:44.380
﻿D-During class...

00:09:44.380 --> 00:09:48.950
﻿He often secretly draws
﻿idea sketches for his Gunpla.

00:09:50.190 --> 00:09:53.160
﻿That's not good for his education.

00:09:54.390 --> 00:09:56.230
﻿Oh, that came out wrong.

00:09:56.230 --> 00:09:59.900
- ﻿I made a mistake...
- ﻿Sei... What a bummer!

00:10:05.540 --> 00:10:06.400
﻿Fellini.

00:10:08.870 --> 00:10:10.070
﻿Go get 'em.

00:10:11.740 --> 00:10:13.010
﻿Now you'll see...

00:10:13.510 --> 00:10:17.920
﻿The Italian Dandy's not just for show.

00:10:21.190 --> 00:10:25.320
<i>﻿We now begin match four
﻿of the quarterfinals.</i>

00:10:25.890 --> 00:10:29.590
﻿After this battle,
﻿all the best 4 will be decided.

00:10:30.300 --> 00:10:32.660
﻿Are you ready Aila?

00:10:32.660 --> 00:10:33.300
﻿I can do it.

00:10:35.130 --> 00:10:37.800
<i>﻿Please set your GP Base.</i>

00:10:45.310 --> 00:10:47.540
<i>﻿Field 4, Mountain.</i>

00:10:51.210 --> 00:10:54.690
﻿- Team Nemesis, Qubeley Papillon.
﻿- Here I go.

00:11:09.730 --> 00:11:14.840
﻿Now let me hit on you,
﻿the legendary undefeated Senorita!

00:11:18.910 --> 00:11:20.710
﻿- <i>Launch funnels!</i>
- ﻿Roger that.

00:11:24.720 --> 00:11:26.480
﻿They're clear funnels.

00:11:45.100 --> 00:11:47.200
﻿The funnels aren't fast enough.

00:11:48.670 --> 00:11:50.740
<i>﻿Aila, what happened?</i>

00:11:50.740 --> 00:11:51.640
<i>﻿Aila!</i>

00:11:53.480 --> 00:11:56.850
﻿If I win this battle,
﻿my next opponent is...

00:11:57.950 --> 00:12:01.320
﻿At this speed, the funnels can't keep up.

00:12:06.020 --> 00:12:07.020
﻿They're invisible,

00:12:07.660 --> 00:12:08.890
<i>﻿but if I can locate them...</i>

00:12:18.140 --> 00:12:20.470
﻿All the clear funnels are wiped out!?

00:12:20.470 --> 00:12:25.540
﻿Aila!

00:12:32.950 --> 00:12:36.650
﻿The undefeated machine
﻿has taken its first direct hit!

00:12:43.900 --> 00:12:45.660
﻿This time they're visible!

00:13:02.780 --> 00:13:04.480
﻿Darn that long interview.

00:13:09.420 --> 00:13:10.090
﻿The battle...?

00:13:20.230 --> 00:13:21.470
﻿Fellini.

00:13:22.130 --> 00:13:23.870
﻿Mr. Ral.

00:13:23.870 --> 00:13:26.370
﻿Ricardo Fellini is fighting very well.

00:13:31.180 --> 00:13:32.280
<i>﻿I'll wipe you out!</i>

00:13:42.290 --> 00:13:43.050
﻿Grandpa.

00:13:43.550 --> 00:13:45.660
﻿Grandpa's Gunpla is...

00:13:45.660 --> 00:13:47.960
﻿Don't worry about it.

00:13:47.960 --> 00:13:49.960
﻿It'll make a comeback soon.

00:13:49.960 --> 00:13:52.200
﻿Just wait a little longer.

00:13:52.200 --> 00:13:53.000
Yes.

00:14:03.670 --> 00:14:04.980
﻿Yes!

00:14:11.150 --> 00:14:13.580
﻿Aila's Embody numbers
﻿are getting lower.

00:14:14.620 --> 00:14:15.650
﻿Why?

00:14:16.990 --> 00:14:19.820
<i>﻿What're you doing? You're getting beaten.</i>

00:14:19.820 --> 00:14:20.990
﻿Ch-Chairman!?

00:14:21.760 --> 00:14:25.230
﻿My grandson wants to see
﻿an overwhelming Nemesis victory.

00:14:25.330 --> 00:14:28.770
<i>﻿Sorry, but there's a problem
﻿with the Embody numbers...</i>

00:14:28.770 --> 00:14:31.330
﻿Then switch to full output right now.

00:14:31.440 --> 00:14:34.070
﻿B-But Aila's body will—!

00:14:34.070 --> 00:14:35.740
<i>﻿I don't care.</i>

00:14:35.740 --> 00:14:37.540
<i>﻿Just win this match.</i>

00:14:38.340 --> 00:14:42.180
<i>﻿If she becomes useless,
﻿then use another one next time.</i>

00:14:43.480 --> 00:14:46.080
﻿That's my order as your sponsor.

00:14:46.780 --> 00:14:48.890
﻿I-I understand.

00:14:51.190 --> 00:14:53.460
﻿He gets hung up on trivial details.

00:14:57.730 --> 00:14:59.430
﻿Don't blame me.

00:14:59.430 --> 00:15:01.570
﻿It's your fault for being off your game.

00:15:05.200 --> 00:15:06.040
﻿What!?

00:15:18.080 --> 00:15:21.620
<i>﻿If you want to be released,
﻿beat him immediately!</i>

00:15:27.430 --> 00:15:29.130
﻿The Qubeley stopped moving?

00:15:30.260 --> 00:15:32.030
﻿A control error?

00:15:32.030 --> 00:15:36.270
﻿Or did she finally fall for my charms?

00:16:00.690 --> 00:16:01.830
﻿What!?

00:16:05.730 --> 00:16:06.800
﻿Why!?

00:16:16.370 --> 00:16:19.480
﻿Because of Sei, we're late again.

00:16:20.010 --> 00:16:21.750
﻿What're you saying?

00:16:21.750 --> 00:16:24.310
﻿You're the one who's
﻿always late, Mr. Reiji.

00:16:24.580 --> 00:16:26.820
﻿No, it's Sei's fault this time.

00:16:26.980 --> 00:16:30.520
﻿It's because Nils was hypnotizing me!

00:16:30.790 --> 00:16:32.660
﻿That was unanticipated.

00:16:32.660 --> 00:16:35.660
﻿I never imagined that
﻿you'd remain in a trance,

00:16:35.660 --> 00:16:38.660
﻿until you'd recited the dialogue
﻿of all 43 Gundam episodes!

00:16:38.960 --> 00:16:43.070
﻿Just hurry up,
﻿or Fellini's battle will be over!

00:16:45.670 --> 00:16:46.940
﻿How's Fellini?

00:16:48.810 --> 00:16:50.340
﻿Wh-What?

00:16:53.380 --> 00:16:55.280
﻿The Wing Gundam Fenice...!

00:16:56.150 --> 00:16:58.550
﻿How come it's so badly damaged!?

00:17:01.120 --> 00:17:03.050
﻿What about his opponent...

00:17:03.050 --> 00:17:05.560
﻿Aila Jyrkiainen's Qubeley?

00:17:07.890 --> 00:17:10.290
﻿It's barely scratched.

00:17:10.290 --> 00:17:12.030
﻿No way...

00:17:12.460 --> 00:17:16.200
﻿Mr. Fellini is losing so one-sidedly?

00:17:17.600 --> 00:17:20.600
﻿She can read my moves perfectly.

00:17:21.440 --> 00:17:24.110
﻿Is that the secret of her strength?

00:17:27.210 --> 00:17:28.450
﻿But it's not over yet!

00:17:31.320 --> 00:17:34.020
﻿Not just yet!

00:17:43.430 --> 00:17:44.790
<i>﻿Give it up, Fellini!</i>

00:17:45.130 --> 00:17:47.060
﻿You can't fight like this!

00:17:47.060 --> 00:17:49.000
<i>﻿Don't talk nonsense!</i>

00:17:49.420 --> 00:17:51.340
I...

00:17:51.340 --> 00:17:54.570
﻿I can't give in this easily!

00:18:08.520 --> 00:18:10.350
﻿What is it doing!?

00:18:10.790 --> 00:18:11.450
﻿It can't be...!

00:18:11.790 --> 00:18:12.420
﻿No!

00:18:13.590 --> 00:18:15.060
﻿I'm inviting you to...

00:18:17.400 --> 00:18:19.000
﻿my self destruction show.

00:18:22.000 --> 00:18:26.570
﻿This is the final curtain call
﻿for the Italian Dandy!

00:18:27.100 --> 00:18:27.840
﻿Coward!

00:18:30.440 --> 00:18:31.210
﻿Kirara!?

00:18:31.380 --> 00:18:33.340
﻿You're so full of yourself.

00:18:33.340 --> 00:18:36.610
﻿Blow yourself up along with an opponent?
﻿You must be kidding!

00:18:37.350 --> 00:18:40.820
﻿What're you fighting for?

00:18:40.820 --> 00:18:41.790
﻿To win, right!?

00:18:42.950 --> 00:18:45.920
﻿Even if you lose today, win tomorrow!

00:18:45.920 --> 00:18:48.220
﻿If not tomorrow,
﻿the day after tomorrow!

00:18:49.230 --> 00:18:51.360
﻿Together with your Fenice!

00:18:54.930 --> 00:18:57.330
﻿Listen to you.

00:19:04.210 --> 00:19:07.880
﻿Now I see this isn't cool.

00:19:08.680 --> 00:19:10.350
﻿Not cool at all.

00:19:11.780 --> 00:19:13.680
﻿Fellini.

00:19:16.690 --> 00:19:18.790
<i>﻿We wish to inform the audience that...</i>

00:19:19.560 --> 00:19:21.690
<i>﻿with the concession of Ricardo Fellini,</i>

00:19:22.390 --> 00:19:24.630
<i>﻿Aila Jyrkiainen is the winner.</i>

00:19:25.730 --> 00:19:27.700
﻿Mr. Fellini...

00:19:27.700 --> 00:19:29.100
﻿He lost.

00:19:29.400 --> 00:19:31.630
﻿Mr. Sei. Mr. Reiji.

00:19:32.500 --> 00:19:33.040
﻿What!?

00:19:40.810 --> 00:19:43.680
﻿What're you doing, Aila!?
﻿The battle is already—

00:19:49.020 --> 00:19:52.720
﻿The Embody output was so high
that her consciousness is...

00:20:09.140 --> 00:20:10.010
﻿Stop...

00:20:10.880 --> 00:20:12.410
﻿Fenice...

00:20:13.910 --> 00:20:14.980
﻿Stop.

00:20:16.480 --> 00:20:18.250
﻿Stop it!!!

00:20:18.520 --> 00:20:20.680
﻿You!!!

00:20:26.620 --> 00:20:28.420
<i>﻿What're you doing!?</i>

00:20:29.390 --> 00:20:31.490
﻿The battle's already decided!

00:20:33.330 --> 00:20:34.160
﻿Reiji!?

00:20:36.400 --> 00:20:39.340
<i>﻿You won alright.</i>

00:20:39.740 --> 00:20:41.200
<i>﻿Stay away from it!</i>

00:20:54.150 --> 00:20:55.850
﻿Reiji's Beginning!

00:20:55.850 --> 00:20:57.320
﻿It's only a straight assembly,

00:20:58.120 --> 00:21:00.320
﻿but how come it broke so easily?

00:21:01.330 --> 00:21:03.330
﻿Wh-What...

00:21:04.630 --> 00:21:06.330
﻿What was that move?

00:21:09.070 --> 00:21:12.640
﻿What the heck are you!?

00:22:44.760 --> 00:22:46.900
<i>﻿Battle aborted.</i>

00:22:51.100 --> 00:22:51.700
﻿Aila!?

00:22:54.040 --> 00:22:56.640
﻿How dare you do that to me.

00:22:58.410 --> 00:23:00.080
- ﻿I'll never forgive you!
﻿- Reiji!?

00:23:00.780 --> 00:23:02.010
﻿Aila?

00:23:02.350 --> 00:23:04.680
﻿Aila.

00:23:05.150 --> 00:23:06.350
﻿Open your eyes!

00:23:13.210 --> 00:23:14.890
I...

00:23:14.890 --> 00:23:17.060
﻿Why did I...?

00:23:17.830 --> 00:23:20.030
﻿Hey, you...

00:23:23.980 --> 00:23:25.940
Rei...ji...

00:23:34.410 --> 00:23:36.880
﻿Aina... what are you doing?

00:23:41.950 --> 00:23:43.290
﻿Hey...

00:23:48.790 --> 00:23:52.530
﻿I said what are you doing, Aina!?

00:23:55.640 --> 00:23:58.170
﻿We'll beat her!
﻿We'll beat her for sure!

00:23:58.170 --> 00:24:00.210
﻿Even so, we want to
﻿understand each other.

00:24:00.210 --> 00:24:02.180
Next episode, "Amid the Glittering Particles."

00:24:02.180 --> 00:24:05.020
Reiji, show the light of the human heart!
